msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_35B96620_2434_4B0B_AFA5_99A6EF685A71"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My request for you is simple—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La mia è una semplice richiesta—"

#: scenario9:scenario9_1B9AB3FD_3DD9_45D8_BBE1_0C6E57870C09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
